index 0000000..edea1e6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/67714.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Added support for a ``minimum`` usage threshold in the ``diskusage`` beacon, alerting when a
+mount's usage drops below the expected level (commonly caused by a filesystem failing to mount).
+Configure it with a ``minimum``/``maximum`` mapping instead of a single percentage value.
diff --git a/salt/beacons/diskusage.py b/salt/beacons/diskusage.py
